Kind: widen
Issue: #881
Holds open: the moment between a receiver parked by the hot path being given its message and taking it off the count -- 60 ms, on a port with a limit of one, so that at more than one processor a sender finds the count full and parks; act_test [45] is the only one that sets such a limit
Run: --entry 14 600 -smp 4

diff --git a/uros/src/mach_kernel/ipc/mach_msg.c b/uros/src/mach_kernel/ipc/mach_msg.c
index a86c9251..47be94b4 100644
--- a/uros/src/mach_kernel/ipc/mach_msg.c
+++ b/uros/src/mach_kernel/ipc/mach_msg.c
@@ -2558,6 +2558,8 @@ urmach_msg_overwrite_trap_call(
 		assert(kmsg != IKM_NULL);
 		dest_port = kmsg->ikm_dest;
 
+		if (dest_port->ip_qlimit == 1)
+			delay(60000);
 		ip_lock(dest_port);
 		urmach_port_message_taken(dest_port);
 		ip_unlock(dest_port);
